[{"id":369,"name":"AlphaRAR.exists_eventually_norm_sub_fderiv_le_mul_sq","kind":"Lemma","keyword":"lemma","module":"AlphaRAR.Mathlib.TaylorRemainder","package":"AlphaRAR","isProp":true,"hashes":{"meaning":"637577fde0991d1f","local":"2f065d2c7253231e","content":"6da61771646868a4"},"doc":"**The `C²` form of `norm_sub_fderiv_le_mul_sq`.** A map that is twice continuously\ndifferentiable at `θ` has a first-order Taylor remainder that is `O(‖x - θ‖²)` near `θ`.\n\nNo Hessian appears: being `C²` makes `fderiv ℝ f` a `C¹` map, hence Lipschitz on a neighbourhood of\n`θ` (`ContDiffAt.exists_lipschitzOnWith`), which is exactly the input `norm_sub_fderiv_le_mul_sq`\nconsumes. ","statement":{"binders":[{"explicit":false,"implicit":true,"name":"E","role":"type","type":"Type u_1","typeRefs":[]},{"explicit":false,"implicit":true,"name":"F","role":"type","type":"Type u_2","typeRefs":[]},{"explicit":false,"head":"NormedAddCommGroup","implicit":false,"name":"","role":"instance","type":"NormedAddCommGroup E","typeRefs":[[0,18,"NormedAddCommGroup"]]},{"explicit":false,"head":"NormedSpace","implicit":false,"name":"","role":"instance","type":"NormedSpace ℝ E","typeRefs":[[0,11,"NormedSpace"],[12,13,"Real"]]},{"explicit":false,"head":"NormedAddCommGroup","implicit":false,"name":"","role":"instance","type":"NormedAddCommGroup F","typeRefs":[[0,18,"NormedAddCommGroup"]]},{"explicit":false,"head":"NormedSpace","implicit":false,"name":"","role":"instance","type":"NormedSpace ℝ F","typeRefs":[[0,11,"NormedSpace"],[12,13,"Real"]]},{"explicit":false,"implicit":true,"name":"f","role":"variable","type":"E → F","typeRefs":[]},{"explicit":false,"implicit":true,"name":"θ","role":"variable","type":"E","typeRefs":[]},{"explicit":true,"head":"ContDiffAt","implicit":false,"name":"hf","role":"hypothesis","type":"ContDiffAt ℝ 2 f θ","typeRefs":[[0,10,"ContDiffAt"],[11,12,"Real"]]}],"conclusion":"∃ K, 0 ≤ K ∧ ∀ᶠ (x : E) in nhds θ, ‖f x - f θ - (fderiv ℝ f θ) (x - θ)‖ ≤ K * ‖x - θ‖ ^ 2","conclusionHead":"Exists","conclusionRefs":[[7,8,"LE.le"],[11,12,"And"],[13,15,"Filter.Eventually"],[24,26,"Filter.Eventually"],[27,31,"nhds"],[35,36,"Norm.norm"],[40,41,"HSub.hSub"],[46,47,"HSub.hSub"],[49,55,"fderiv"],[56,57,"Real"],[66,67,"HSub.hSub"],[70,71,"Norm.norm"],[72,73,"LE.le"],[76,77,"HMul.hMul"],[78,79,"Norm.norm"],[81,82,"HSub.hSub"],[84,85,"Norm.norm"],[86,87,"HPow.hPow"]],"decl":"AlphaRAR.exists_eventually_norm_sub_fderiv_le_mul_sq"},"code":"/-- **The `C²` form of `norm_sub_fderiv_le_mul_sq`.** A map that is twice continuously\ndifferentiable at `θ` has a first-order Taylor remainder that is `O(‖x - θ‖²)` near `θ`.\n\nNo Hessian appears: being `C²` makes `fderiv ℝ f` a `C¹` map, hence Lipschitz on a neighbourhood of\n`θ` (`ContDiffAt.exists_lipschitzOnWith`), which is exactly the input `norm_sub_fderiv_le_mul_sq`\nconsumes. -/\nlemma exists_eventually_norm_sub_fderiv_le_mul_sq {f : E → F} {θ : E}\n    (hf : ContDiffAt ℝ 2 f θ) :\n    ∃ K : ℝ, 0 ≤ K ∧\n      ∀ᶠ x in 𝓝 θ, ‖f x - f θ - fderiv ℝ f θ (x - θ)‖ ≤ K * ‖x - θ‖ ^ 2","proof":":= by\n  obtain ⟨K, t, ht, hlip⟩ := (hf.fderiv_right (m := 1) (by norm_num)).exists_lipschitzOnWith\n  have hdiff : ∀ᶠ y in 𝓝 θ, DifferentiableAt ℝ f y := by\n    filter_upwards [hf.eventually (by norm_num)] with y hy\n    exact hy.differentiableAt two_ne_zero\n  obtain ⟨r, hr, hsub⟩ := Metric.mem_nhds_iff.mp (Filter.inter_mem ht hdiff)\n  refine ⟨(K : ℝ), K.coe_nonneg, ?_⟩\n  filter_upwards [Metric.ball_mem_nhds θ hr] with x hx\n  refine norm_sub_fderiv_le_mul_sq (f' := fderiv ℝ f) K.coe_nonneg (convex_ball θ r)\n    (fun z hz ↦ (hsub hz).2.hasFDerivAt) (fun z hz ↦ ?_) (Metric.mem_ball_self hr) hx\n  have hd := hlip.dist_le_mul z (hsub hz).1 θ (hsub (Metric.mem_ball_self hr)).1\n  rwa [dist_eq_norm, dist_eq_norm] at hd","source":{"path":"AlphaRAR/Mathlib/TaylorRemainder.lean","start":79,"end":99,"url":"https://github.com/RemyDegenne/alpha-rar/blob/e7164a80baea3f4f65e108de31d2d561dd35e350/AlphaRAR/Mathlib/TaylorRemainder.lean#L79-L99"},"deps":[],"outside":[],"external":[["AddCommGroup.toAddCommMonoid","mathlib","instance"],["AddCommGroup.toAddGroup","mathlib","instance"],["AddGroup.toSubNegMonoid","mathlib","instance"],["And","lean4","structure"],["CommSemiring.toSemiring","mathlib","instance"],["ContDiffAt","mathlib","definition"],["ContinuousLinearMap","mathlib","structure"],["ContinuousLinearMap.funLike","mathlib","instance"],["DFunLike.coe","mathlib","definition"],["DenselyNormedField.toNontriviallyNormedField","mathlib","instance"],["ENat","mathlib","definition"],["ENat.instNatCast","mathlib","instance"],["Exists","lean4","inductive"],["Field.toSemifield","mathlib","instance"],["Filter.Eventually","mathlib","definition"],["HMul.hMul","lean4","definition"],["HPow.hPow","lean4","definition"],["HSub.hSub","lean4","definition"],["LE.le","lean4","definition"],["Monoid.toNPow","mathlib","instance"],["NPow.toPow","mathlib","instance"],["Nat","lean4","inductive"],["Nat.instAtLeastTwoHAddOfNat","mathlib","instance"],["Nat.instNeZeroSucc","lean4","instance"],["NontriviallyNormedField.toNormedField","mathlib","instance"],["Norm.norm","mathlib","definition"],["NormedAddCommGroup","mathlib","class"],["NormedAddCommGroup.toAddCommGroup","mathlib","instance"],["NormedAddCommGroup.toNorm","mathlib","instance"],["NormedAddCommGroup.toSeminormedAddCommGroup","mathlib","instance"],["NormedField.toField","mathlib","instance"],["NormedSpace","mathlib","class"],["NormedSpace.toModule","mathlib","instance"],["OfNat.ofNat","lean4","definition"],["PseudoMetricSpace.toUniformSpace","mathlib","instance"],["Real","mathlib","structure"],["Real.denselyNormedField","mathlib","instance"],["Real.instLE","mathlib","instance"],["Real.instMonoid","mathlib","instance"],["Real.instMul","mathlib","instance"],["Real.instZero","mathlib","instance"],["Real.normedField","mathlib","instance"],["RingHom.id","mathlib","definition"],["Semifield.toCommSemiring","mathlib","instance"],["SeminormedAddCommGroup.toPseudoMetricSpace","mathlib","instance"],["Semiring.toNonAssocSemiring","mathlib","instance"],["SubNegMonoid.toSub","mathlib","instance"],["UniformSpace.toTopologicalSpace","mathlib","instance"],["WithTop","mathlib","definition"],["WithTop.natCast","mathlib","instance"],["Zero.toOfNat0","lean4","instance"],["fderiv","mathlib","definition"],["instHMul","lean4","instance"],["instHPow","lean4","instance"],["instHSub","lean4","instance"],["instOfNatAtLeastTwo","mathlib","instance"],["instOfNatNat","lean4","instance"],["nhds","mathlib","definition"]],"users":[],"sorry":false,"ownSorry":false,"sorryVia":[],"axioms":[],"change":null,"reviews":[],"claim":null,"specifies":[],"specifiedBy":[],"characterizations":[],"pulled":false,"directExternal":["AddCommGroup.toAddCommMonoid","AddCommGroup.toAddGroup","AddGroup.toSubNegMonoid","And","CommSemiring.toSemiring","ContDiffAt","ContinuousLinearMap","ContinuousLinearMap.funLike","DFunLike.coe","DenselyNormedField.toNontriviallyNormedField","ENat","ENat.instNatCast","Exists","Field.toSemifield","Filter.Eventually","HMul.hMul","HPow.hPow","HSub.hSub","LE.le","Monoid.toNPow","NPow.toPow","Nat","Nat.instAtLeastTwoHAddOfNat","Nat.instNeZeroSucc","NontriviallyNormedField.toNormedField","Norm.norm","NormedAddCommGroup","NormedAddCommGroup.toAddCommGroup","NormedAddCommGroup.toNorm","NormedAddCommGroup.toSeminormedAddCommGroup","NormedField.toField","NormedSpace","NormedSpace.toModule","OfNat.ofNat","PseudoMetricSpace.toUniformSpace","Real","Real.denselyNormedField","Real.instLE","Real.instMonoid","Real.instMul","Real.instZero","Real.normedField","RingHom.id","Semifield.toCommSemiring","SeminormedAddCommGroup.toPseudoMetricSpace","Semiring.toNonAssocSemiring","SubNegMonoid.toSub","UniformSpace.toTopologicalSpace","WithTop","WithTop.natCast","Zero.toOfNat0","fderiv","instHMul","instHPow","instHSub","instOfNatAtLeastTwo","instOfNatNat","nhds"],"provenance":null,"edited":{"commit":"626a0ba966ded368c52c5fcad1f75afbe62507b6","date":"2026-09-01"}},{"id":370,"name":"AlphaRAR.exists_eventually_sub_le_mul_sq_of_isLocalMin","kind":"Lemma","keyword":"lemma","module":"AlphaRAR.Mathlib.TaylorRemainder","package":"AlphaRAR","isProp":true,"hashes":{"meaning":"92b6eb25d5fa8db1","local":"8d8318de0cbc9310","content":"b05163d06bd216c3"},"doc":"**A `C²` function is quadratically small near a local minimum**: `f x - f θ ≤ K‖x - θ‖²`.\n\nBy Fermat's theorem the linear term of the Taylor expansion vanishes at `θ`, so the whole increment\nis the quadratic remainder of `exists_eventually_norm_sub_fderiv_le_mul_sq`. This is the standard\n\"second-order expansion at a minimum\" without ever naming the Hessian. ","statement":{"binders":[{"explicit":false,"implicit":true,"name":"E","role":"type","type":"Type u_1","typeRefs":[]},{"explicit":false,"head":"NormedAddCommGroup","implicit":false,"name":"","role":"instance","type":"NormedAddCommGroup E","typeRefs":[[0,18,"NormedAddCommGroup"]]},{"explicit":false,"head":"NormedSpace","implicit":false,"name":"","role":"instance","type":"NormedSpace ℝ E","typeRefs":[[0,11,"NormedSpace"],[12,13,"Real"]]},{"explicit":false,"implicit":true,"name":"f","role":"variable","type":"E → ℝ","typeRefs":[[4,5,"Real"]]},{"explicit":false,"implicit":true,"name":"θ","role":"variable","type":"E","typeRefs":[]},{"explicit":true,"head":"IsLocalMin","implicit":false,"name":"hmin","role":"hypothesis","type":"IsLocalMin f θ","typeRefs":[[0,10,"IsLocalMin"]]},{"explicit":true,"head":"ContDiffAt","implicit":false,"name":"hf","role":"hypothesis","type":"ContDiffAt ℝ 2 f θ","typeRefs":[[0,10,"ContDiffAt"],[11,12,"Real"]]}],"conclusion":"∃ K, 0 ≤ K ∧ ∀ᶠ (x : E) in nhds θ, f x - f θ ≤ K * ‖x - θ‖ ^ 2","conclusionHead":"Exists","conclusionRefs":[[7,8,"LE.le"],[11,12,"And"],[13,15,"Filter.Eventually"],[24,26,"Filter.Eventually"],[27,31,"nhds"],[39,40,"HSub.hSub"],[45,46,"LE.le"],[49,50,"HMul.hMul"],[51,52,"Norm.norm"],[54,55,"HSub.hSub"],[57,58,"Norm.norm"],[59,60,"HPow.hPow"]],"decl":"AlphaRAR.exists_eventually_sub_le_mul_sq_of_isLocalMin"},"code":"/-- **A `C²` function is quadratically small near a local minimum**: `f x - f θ ≤ K‖x - θ‖²`.\n\nBy Fermat's theorem the linear term of the Taylor expansion vanishes at `θ`, so the whole increment\nis the quadratic remainder of `exists_eventually_norm_sub_fderiv_le_mul_sq`. This is the standard\n\"second-order expansion at a minimum\" without ever naming the Hessian. -/\nlemma exists_eventually_sub_le_mul_sq_of_isLocalMin {f : E → ℝ} {θ : E} (hmin : IsLocalMin f θ)\n    (hf : ContDiffAt ℝ 2 f θ) :\n    ∃ K : ℝ, 0 ≤ K ∧ ∀ᶠ x in 𝓝 θ, f x - f θ ≤ K * ‖x - θ‖ ^ 2","proof":":= by\n  obtain ⟨K, hK, hbd⟩ := exists_eventually_norm_sub_fderiv_le_mul_sq hf\n  refine ⟨K, hK, ?_⟩\n  filter_upwards [hbd] with x hx\n  rw [hmin.fderiv_eq_zero] at hx\n  simp only [zero_apply, sub_zero, Real.norm_eq_abs] at hx\n  exact (le_abs_self _).trans hx","source":{"path":"AlphaRAR/Mathlib/TaylorRemainder.lean","start":101,"end":114,"url":"https://github.com/RemyDegenne/alpha-rar/blob/e7164a80baea3f4f65e108de31d2d561dd35e350/AlphaRAR/Mathlib/TaylorRemainder.lean#L101-L114"},"deps":[],"outside":[],"external":[["AddCommGroup.toAddGroup","mathlib","instance"],["AddGroup.toSubNegMonoid","mathlib","instance"],["And","lean4","structure"],["ContDiffAt","mathlib","definition"],["DenselyNormedField.toNontriviallyNormedField","mathlib","instance"],["ENat","mathlib","definition"],["ENat.instNatCast","mathlib","instance"],["Exists","lean4","inductive"],["Filter.Eventually","mathlib","definition"],["HMul.hMul","lean4","definition"],["HPow.hPow","lean4","definition"],["HSub.hSub","lean4","definition"],["IsLocalMin","mathlib","definition"],["LE.le","lean4","definition"],["Monoid.toNPow","mathlib","instance"],["NPow.toPow","mathlib","instance"],["Nat","lean4","inductive"],["Nat.instAtLeastTwoHAddOfNat","mathlib","instance"],["Nat.instNeZeroSucc","lean4","instance"],["NontriviallyNormedField.toNormedField","mathlib","instance"],["Norm.norm","mathlib","definition"],["NormedAddCommGroup","mathlib","class"],["NormedAddCommGroup.toAddCommGroup","mathlib","instance"],["NormedAddCommGroup.toNorm","mathlib","instance"],["NormedAddCommGroup.toSeminormedAddCommGroup","mathlib","instance"],["NormedField.toNormedSpace","mathlib","instance"],["NormedSpace","mathlib","class"],["OfNat.ofNat","lean4","definition"],["PseudoMetricSpace.toUniformSpace","mathlib","instance"],["Real","mathlib","structure"],["Real.denselyNormedField","mathlib","instance"],["Real.instLE","mathlib","instance"],["Real.instMonoid","mathlib","instance"],["Real.instMul","mathlib","instance"],["Real.instPreorder","mathlib","instance"],["Real.instSub","mathlib","instance"],["Real.instZero","mathlib","instance"],["Real.normedAddCommGroup","mathlib","instance"],["Real.normedField","mathlib","instance"],["SeminormedAddCommGroup.toPseudoMetricSpace","mathlib","instance"],["SubNegMonoid.toSub","mathlib","instance"],["UniformSpace.toTopologicalSpace","mathlib","instance"],["WithTop","mathlib","definition"],["WithTop.natCast","mathlib","instance"],["Zero.toOfNat0","lean4","instance"],["instHMul","lean4","instance"],["instHPow","lean4","instance"],["instHSub","lean4","instance"],["instOfNatAtLeastTwo","mathlib","instance"],["instOfNatNat","lean4","instance"],["nhds","mathlib","definition"]],"users":[],"sorry":false,"ownSorry":false,"sorryVia":[],"axioms":[],"change":null,"reviews":[],"claim":null,"specifies":[],"specifiedBy":[],"characterizations":[],"pulled":false,"directExternal":["AddCommGroup.toAddGroup","AddGroup.toSubNegMonoid","And","ContDiffAt","DenselyNormedField.toNontriviallyNormedField","ENat","ENat.instNatCast","Exists","Filter.Eventually","HMul.hMul","HPow.hPow","HSub.hSub","IsLocalMin","LE.le","Monoid.toNPow","NPow.toPow","Nat","Nat.instAtLeastTwoHAddOfNat","Nat.instNeZeroSucc","NontriviallyNormedField.toNormedField","Norm.norm","NormedAddCommGroup","NormedAddCommGroup.toAddCommGroup","NormedAddCommGroup.toNorm","NormedAddCommGroup.toSeminormedAddCommGroup","NormedField.toNormedSpace","NormedSpace","OfNat.ofNat","PseudoMetricSpace.toUniformSpace","Real","Real.denselyNormedField","Real.instLE","Real.instMonoid","Real.instMul","Real.instPreorder","Real.instSub","Real.instZero","Real.normedAddCommGroup","Real.normedField","SeminormedAddCommGroup.toPseudoMetricSpace","SubNegMonoid.toSub","UniformSpace.toTopologicalSpace","WithTop","WithTop.natCast","Zero.toOfNat0","instHMul","instHPow","instHSub","instOfNatAtLeastTwo","instOfNatNat","nhds"],"provenance":null,"edited":{"commit":"626a0ba966ded368c52c5fcad1f75afbe62507b6","date":"2026-09-01"}},{"id":371,"name":"AlphaRAR.sq_norm_le_sum_sq","kind":"Lemma","keyword":"lemma","module":"AlphaRAR.Mathlib.TaylorRemainder","package":"AlphaRAR","isProp":true,"hashes":{"meaning":"4995950682936bb8","local":"a5853f9d1892b273","content":"82eee8c0bcc26687"},"doc":"On a finite product carrying the sup norm, the squared norm is at most the sum of the squared\ncoordinates. This converts the quadratic bounds above into the coordinatewise form in which\nper-coordinate rates plug in. ","statement":{"binders":[{"explicit":false,"implicit":true,"name":"ι","role":"type","type":"Type u_3","typeRefs":[]},{"explicit":false,"head":"Fintype","implicit":false,"name":"","role":"instance","type":"Fintype ι","typeRefs":[[0,7,"Fintype"]]},{"explicit":true,"implicit":false,"name":"x","role":"variable","type":"ι → ℝ","typeRefs":[[4,5,"Real"]]}],"conclusion":"‖x‖ ^ 2 ≤ ∑ j, x j ^ 2","conclusionHead":"LE.le","conclusionRefs":[[0,1,"Norm.norm"],[2,3,"Norm.norm"],[4,5,"HPow.hPow"],[8,9,"LE.le"],[19,20,"HPow.hPow"]],"decl":"AlphaRAR.sq_norm_le_sum_sq"},"code":"/-- On a finite product carrying the sup norm, the squared norm is at most the sum of the squared\ncoordinates. This converts the quadratic bounds above into the coordinatewise form in which\nper-coordinate rates plug in. -/\nlemma sq_norm_le_sum_sq {ι : Type*} [Fintype ι] (x : ι → ℝ) : ‖x‖ ^ 2 ≤ ∑ j, x j ^ 2","proof":":= by\n  rcases isEmpty_or_nonempty ι with hι | hι\n  · have hx : x = 0 := funext fun j ↦ hι.elim j\n    simp [hx]\n  · obtain ⟨j₀, hj₀⟩ := Finite.exists_max fun j ↦ ‖x j‖\n    have hnorm : ‖x‖ = ‖x j₀‖ :=\n      le_antisymm ((pi_norm_le_iff_of_nonneg (norm_nonneg _)).2 hj₀) (norm_le_pi_norm x j₀)\n    rw [hnorm, Real.norm_eq_abs, sq_abs]\n    exact Finset.single_le_sum (f := fun j ↦ x j ^ 2) (fun j _ ↦ sq_nonneg _) (Finset.mem_univ j₀)","source":{"path":"AlphaRAR/Mathlib/TaylorRemainder.lean","start":116,"end":127,"url":"https://github.com/RemyDegenne/alpha-rar/blob/e7164a80baea3f4f65e108de31d2d561dd35e350/AlphaRAR/Mathlib/TaylorRemainder.lean#L116-L127"},"deps":[],"outside":[],"external":[["Finset.sum","mathlib","definition"],["Finset.univ","mathlib","definition"],["Fintype","mathlib","class"],["HPow.hPow","lean4","definition"],["LE.le","lean4","definition"],["Monoid.toNPow","mathlib","instance"],["NPow.toPow","mathlib","instance"],["Nat","lean4","inductive"],["Norm.norm","mathlib","definition"],["NormedCommRing.toNormedRing","mathlib","instance"],["NormedRing.toNorm","mathlib","instance"],["OfNat.ofNat","lean4","definition"],["Pi.normedRing","mathlib","instance"],["Real","mathlib","structure"],["Real.instAddCommMonoid","mathlib","instance"],["Real.instLE","mathlib","instance"],["Real.instMonoid","mathlib","instance"],["Real.normedCommRing","mathlib","instance"],["instHPow","lean4","instance"],["instOfNatNat","lean4","instance"]],"users":[],"sorry":false,"ownSorry":false,"sorryVia":[],"axioms":[],"change":null,"reviews":[],"claim":null,"specifies":[],"specifiedBy":[],"characterizations":[],"pulled":false,"directExternal":["Finset.sum","Finset.univ","Fintype","HPow.hPow","LE.le","Monoid.toNPow","NPow.toPow","Nat","Norm.norm","NormedCommRing.toNormedRing","NormedRing.toNorm","OfNat.ofNat","Pi.normedRing","Real","Real.instAddCommMonoid","Real.instLE","Real.instMonoid","Real.normedCommRing","instHPow","instOfNatNat"],"provenance":null,"edited":{"commit":"626a0ba966ded368c52c5fcad1f75afbe62507b6","date":"2026-09-01"}},{"id":372,"name":"AlphaRAR.norm_sub_fderiv_le_mul_sq","kind":"Lemma","keyword":"lemma","module":"AlphaRAR.Mathlib.TaylorRemainder","package":"AlphaRAR","isProp":true,"hashes":{"meaning":"1a0894eb4a2a0696","local":"850450d61776887b","content":"c70ddfb8d5cb69c7"},"doc":"**Quadratic remainder bound for the first-order Taylor expansion.** If `f` is differentiable on\na convex set `s` with derivative `f'`, and `f'` is `K`-Lipschitz relative to `θ` on `s`\n(`‖f' z - f' θ‖ ≤ K‖z - θ‖`), then for `x ∈ s`,\n`‖f x - f θ - f' θ (x - θ)‖ ≤ K‖x - θ‖²`. ","statement":{"binders":[{"explicit":false,"implicit":true,"name":"E","role":"type","type":"Type u_1","typeRefs":[]},{"explicit":false,"implicit":true,"name":"F","role":"type","type":"Type u_2","typeRefs":[]},{"explicit":false,"head":"NormedAddCommGroup","implicit":false,"name":"","role":"instance","type":"NormedAddCommGroup E","typeRefs":[[0,18,"NormedAddCommGroup"]]},{"explicit":false,"head":"NormedSpace","implicit":false,"name":"","role":"instance","type":"NormedSpace ℝ E","typeRefs":[[0,11,"NormedSpace"],[12,13,"Real"]]},{"explicit":false,"head":"NormedAddCommGroup","implicit":false,"name":"","role":"instance","type":"NormedAddCommGroup F","typeRefs":[[0,18,"NormedAddCommGroup"]]},{"explicit":false,"head":"NormedSpace","implicit":false,"name":"","role":"instance","type":"NormedSpace ℝ F","typeRefs":[[0,11,"NormedSpace"],[12,13,"Real"]]},{"explicit":false,"implicit":true,"name":"f","role":"variable","type":"E → F","typeRefs":[]},{"explicit":false,"implicit":true,"name":"f'","role":"variable","type":"E → E →L[ℝ] F","typeRefs":[[6,9,"ContinuousLinearMap"],[9,10,"Real"]]},{"explicit":false,"head":"Set","implicit":true,"name":"s","role":"variable","type":"Set E","typeRefs":[[0,3,"Set"]]},{"explicit":false,"implicit":true,"name":"θ","role":"variable","type":"E","typeRefs":[]},{"explicit":false,"implicit":true,"name":"x","role":"variable","type":"E","typeRefs":[]},{"explicit":false,"head":"Real","implicit":true,"name":"K","role":"variable","type":"ℝ","typeRefs":[[0,1,"Real"]]},{"explicit":true,"head":"LE.le","implicit":false,"name":"hK","role":"hypothesis","type":"0 ≤ K","typeRefs":[[2,3,"LE.le"]]},{"explicit":true,"head":"Convex","implicit":false,"name":"hs","role":"hypothesis","type":"Convex ℝ s","typeRefs":[[0,6,"Convex"],[7,8,"Real"]]},{"explicit":true,"implicit":false,"name":"hf","role":"hypothesis","type":"∀ z ∈ s, HasFDerivAt f (f' z) z","typeRefs":[[9,20,"HasFDerivAt"]]},{"explicit":true,"implicit":false,"name":"hlip","role":"hypothesis","type":"∀ z ∈ s, ‖f' z - f' θ‖ ≤ K * ‖z - θ‖","typeRefs":[[9,10,"Norm.norm"],[15,16,"HSub.hSub"],[21,22,"Norm.norm"],[23,24,"LE.le"],[27,28,"HMul.hMul"],[29,30,"Norm.norm"],[32,33,"HSub.hSub"],[35,36,"Norm.norm"]]},{"explicit":true,"head":"Membership.mem","implicit":false,"name":"hθ","role":"hypothesis","type":"θ ∈ s","typeRefs":[[2,3,"Membership.mem"]]},{"explicit":true,"head":"Membership.mem","implicit":false,"name":"hx","role":"hypothesis","type":"x ∈ s","typeRefs":[[2,3,"Membership.mem"]]}],"conclusion":"‖f x - f θ - (f' θ) (x - θ)‖ ≤ K * ‖x - θ‖ ^ 2","conclusionHead":"LE.le","conclusionRefs":[[0,1,"Norm.norm"],[5,6,"HSub.hSub"],[11,12,"HSub.hSub"],[23,24,"HSub.hSub"],[27,28,"Norm.norm"],[29,30,"LE.le"],[33,34,"HMul.hMul"],[35,36,"Norm.norm"],[38,39,"HSub.hSub"],[41,42,"Norm.norm"],[43,44,"HPow.hPow"]],"decl":"AlphaRAR.norm_sub_fderiv_le_mul_sq"},"code":"/-- **Quadratic remainder bound for the first-order Taylor expansion.** If `f` is differentiable on\na convex set `s` with derivative `f'`, and `f'` is `K`-Lipschitz relative to `θ` on `s`\n(`‖f' z - f' θ‖ ≤ K‖z - θ‖`), then for `x ∈ s`,\n`‖f x - f θ - f' θ (x - θ)‖ ≤ K‖x - θ‖²`. -/\nlemma norm_sub_fderiv_le_mul_sq {f : E → F} {f' : E → E →L[ℝ] F} {s : Set E} {θ x : E} {K : ℝ}\n    (hK : 0 ≤ K) (hs : Convex ℝ s) (hf : ∀ z ∈ s, HasFDerivAt f (f' z) z)\n    (hlip : ∀ z ∈ s, ‖f' z - f' θ‖ ≤ K * ‖z - θ‖) (hθ : θ ∈ s) (hx : x ∈ s) :\n    ‖f x - f θ - f' θ (x - θ)‖ ≤ K * ‖x - θ‖ ^ 2","proof":":= by\n  have hseg : segment ℝ θ x ⊆ s := hs.segment_subset hθ hx\n  have hbound : ∀ z ∈ segment ℝ θ x, ‖f' z - f' θ‖ ≤ K * ‖x - θ‖ := by\n    intro z hz\n    have hzs : z ∈ s := hseg hz\n    rw [segment_eq_image] at hz\n    obtain ⟨t, ht, rfl⟩ := hz\n    have hzθ : (1 - t) • θ + t • x - θ = t • (x - θ) := by module\n    calc ‖f' ((1 - t) • θ + t • x) - f' θ‖\n        ≤ K * ‖(1 - t) • θ + t • x - θ‖ := hlip _ hzs\n      _ = K * (t * ‖x - θ‖) := by rw [hzθ, norm_smul, Real.norm_of_nonneg ht.1]\n      _ ≤ K * (1 * ‖x - θ‖) := by gcongr; exact ht.2\n      _ = K * ‖x - θ‖ := by rw [one_mul]\n  have key := Convex.norm_image_sub_le_of_norm_hasFDerivWithin_le'\n    (fun z hz ↦ (hf z (hseg hz)).hasFDerivWithinAt) hbound (convex_segment θ x)\n    (left_mem_segment ℝ θ x) (right_mem_segment ℝ θ x)\n  calc ‖f x - f θ - f' θ (x - θ)‖\n      ≤ K * ‖x - θ‖ * ‖x - θ‖ := key\n    _ = K * ‖x - θ‖ ^ 2 := by ring","source":{"path":"AlphaRAR/Mathlib/TaylorRemainder.lean","start":52,"end":77,"url":"https://github.com/RemyDegenne/alpha-rar/blob/e7164a80baea3f4f65e108de31d2d561dd35e350/AlphaRAR/Mathlib/TaylorRemainder.lean#L52-L77"},"deps":[],"outside":[],"external":[["AddCommGroup.toAddCommMonoid","mathlib","instance"],["AddCommGroup.toAddGroup","mathlib","instance"],["AddGroup.toSubNegMonoid","mathlib","instance"],["AddMonoid.toAddZeroClass","mathlib","instance"],["AddZero.toZero","mathlib","instance"],["AddZeroClass.toAddZero","mathlib","instance"],["ContinuousLinearMap","mathlib","structure"],["ContinuousLinearMap.funLike","mathlib","instance"],["ContinuousLinearMap.hasOpNorm","mathlib","instance"],["ContinuousLinearMap.sub","mathlib","instance"],["Convex","mathlib","definition"],["DFunLike.coe","mathlib","definition"],["DenselyNormedField.toNontriviallyNormedField","mathlib","instance"],["DistribMulAction.toDistribSMul","mathlib","instance"],["DistribSMul.toSMulZeroClass","mathlib","instance"],["HMul.hMul","lean4","definition"],["HPow.hPow","lean4","definition"],["HSub.hSub","lean4","definition"],["HasFDerivAt","mathlib","definition"],["